  "title": "SoftBank Eyes Massive $25B Stake in OpenAI - A Tectonic Shift in AI Investment",
  "summary": "SoftBank is in discussions to invest $25 billion in OpenAI as part of a groundbreaking $40 billion AI partnership initiative. This major move would make SoftBank the largest single investor in OpenAI, surpassing Microsoft, and signifies a strategic shift in AI industry dynamics. With the accompanying $100 billion Stargate data center project, this investment aims to create an independent AI infrastructure powerhouse.",
